welve kingdoms, each with its own independent network of online servers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b82a6c73f0716d9b918c59fd9f8fe104.avif?t=1765567490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/b82a6c73f0716d9b918c59fd9f8fe104.avif?t=1765567490 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><br><br><br><br> <br><strong>Yes, there will be a mythical Round Table as well as twelve knights and a king--if we opt to have a monarch in the future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/5adfcd2b026b88d17d5aa0fc5826bf76.avif?t=1765567490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/5adfcd2b026b88d17d5aa0fc5826bf76.avif?t=1765567490 width=800 height=440 /></span><strong>In the early release, each kingdom features a grand castle with a lively town inside its walls. Surrounding it are villages, bustling towns, seven harbors, and vast seas to explore. Brave the depths of many dungeons filled with clever puzzles and daring jumps, offering endless adventures for all explorers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/7a8ba0f74d8309f9c767ee994d91f807.avif?t=1765567490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/7a8ba0f74d8309f9c767ee994d91f807.avif?t=1765567490 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mages and healers will love our two druid classes: Earth and Water Druids. Each has a unique skill set, making them powerful allies in raids and the quest for dragon eggs.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b7fd51aa8efe615540ac678ea1b95673.poster.avif?t=1765567490\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b7fd51aa8efe615540ac678ea1b95673.webm?t=1765567490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b7fd51aa8efe615540ac678ea1b95673.mp4?t=1765567490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare to raise the most coveted and powerful flying mounts\u2014Fire, Ice, and Water Dragons! Players will nurture their dragons from eggs, watch them grow into loyal pets, and ultimately unleash them as formidable battle mounts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/8c3b21b328c5c0fe241089456fefb4ef.avif?t=1765567490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/8c3b21b328c5c0fe241089456fefb4ef.avif?t=1765567490 width=800 height=430 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players will be able to freely move between kingdoms upon reaching level twenty or simply by owning homes, service providing buildings or portals in one of the kingdoms.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/d5785010a49c9279ba0a57a365ba18e6.avif?t=1765567490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/d5785010a49c9279ba0a57a365ba18e6.avif?t=1765567490 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The multiplayer raids are limited to six characters and will consist of following four classes:</strong><br><br> <br><strong>Ranged - Elves, Robin In The Hood </strong><br> <br> <br> <br><strong>Tanks - The Viking Clans , The Knights of King Arthur , The Brotherhood of Templars </strong><br> <br> <br> <br><strong>Healers - The Druids , Herne the Hunter </strong><br> <br> <br> <br><strong>Mages - Merlin- Earth, The Grand Inquisitor- Fire , The Templar Grand Master -Ice</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/803bcc615736b56585336de006e69914.avif?t=1765567490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/803bcc615736b56585336de006e69914.avif?t=1765567490 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>6\u20138 player co-op raids with\u00a0 first-person, third-person, and far zoom out camera views - play the way you love in a truly immersive RPG experience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/4dc0ad76c0c8c84f29f9e4c5188f5c67.avif?t=1765567490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/4dc0ad76c0c8c84f29f9e4c5188f5c67.avif?t=1765567490 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy true open world exploration, alone, with a friend, or with a companion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/152e269cc766bfdc236297c942e9c2cc.avif?t=1765567490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/152e269cc766bfdc236297c942e9c2cc.avif?t=1765567490 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>In the lands of Avalon, there\u2019s something for everyone. Whether you're a lone traveler exploring vast horizons, a fearless leader in raids, a skilled weapon crafter, a keen hunter, or a fisherman and chef, Avalon welcomes you. And through it all, follow a rich quest line\u00a0 that guides you through the alternate history of the Knights Templar. All this and more awaits every adventurer\u2019s spirit in our world.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/a836bf05a9e7c737bf85f30eb86a8256.avif?t=1765567490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/a836bf05a9e7c737bf85f30eb86a8256.avif?t=1765567490 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["Danu Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/272ffc153287042a2ae62e7a4299a7dffb7edd2e/header.jpg?t=1765567490","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3281500/770063/8e38588964c44